## 🔴 Critical Integration Gaps (Findings)

### Gap 1: Cash Transaction Form Has NO Supplier Dropdown
[AddCashTransactionModal.tsx](file:///c:/Users/mahmo/Contacts/CLAUDE_CO%20WORK%20MY%20WORK/agri-nile-flow/web/src/components/forms/AddCashTransactionModal.tsx)

The backend `POST /api/treasury/transactions` accepts `supplier_code`, `season_id`, `expense_code` — but the **form only shows 6 basic fields**: date, direction, narration, amount, document_number, recipient_name.

**Missing from form:**
- 🔴 `supplier_code` — Dropdown to link payment to a supplier
- 🔴 `season_id` — Dropdown to link to active season
- 🔴 `expense_code` — Dropdown for expense type classification
- 🟡 `unit`, `quantity`, `unit_price` — For itemized expenses

**Impact:** Cash payments to suppliers have ZERO traceability. You can't filter treasury by supplier or season.

---

### Gap 2: Supplier Transaction Form Has NO Dropdown for Key Fields
[AddSupplierTransactionModal.tsx](file:///c:/Users/mahmo/Contacts/CLAUDE_CO%20WORK%20MY%20WORK/agri-nile-flow/web/src/components/forms/AddSupplierTransactionModal.tsx)

**Missing dropdowns (plain text inputs instead):**
- 🔴 `document_type` — Typed as free text ("فاتورة / شيك / تحويل...") instead of a dropdown
- 🔴 `expense_category` — Free text instead of dropdown from `expense_types` config
- 🔴 `unit` — Free text ("طن / كجم...") instead of item_units lookup
- 🔴 `season_id` — Not exposed at all (backend accepts it)
- 🔴 `center_code` — Not exposed (backend accepts it) — **this breaks cost center reporting**
- 🔴 `account_code` — Not exposed (backend accepts it)

**Impact:** Data quality is terrible. Same expense category entered as "بذور", "بذور ", "بزور" = 3 different entries in reports.

---

### Gap 3: Inventory → Cost Center Link is Backend-Only
[AddInventoryBatchModal.tsx](file:///c:/Users/mahmo/Contacts/CLAUDE_CO%20WORK%20MY%20WORK/agri-nile-flow/web/src/components/forms/AddInventoryBatchModal.tsx) — Line 37

The `BatchForm` interface includes `field_id`, `work_order_id`, `season_id` but **NOT `center_code`**.
The backend `POST /api/inventory/movements` accepts `center_code` but the form never sends it.

**Impact:** Cost center dimension analysis (`reports/cost-centers`) cannot track inventory-related expenses accurately.

