### Gap 4: GL Account Mapping Dropdown Shows Code Only, Not Name
[ChartOfAccountsPage.tsx](file:///c:/Users/mahmo/Contacts/CLAUDE_CO%20WORK%20MY%20WORK/agri-nile-flow/web/src/pages/gl/ChartOfAccountsPage.tsx#L389-L391)

