### Gap 5: Season Close Workflow Has No Financial Validation
[ConfigPage.tsx](file:///c:/Users/mahmo/Contacts/CLAUDE_CO%20WORK%20MY%20WORK/agri-nile-flow/web/src/pages/config/ConfigPage.tsx#L53-L57)

```tsx
// Line 53-57: Season status change is a simple API call with no checks
const change = async (status: string) => {
  setOpen(false)
  await configApi.updateSeasonStatus(season.id, status)
}
```

When closing a season (`closed`), there's **NO validation** for:
- Unposted journal entries in the season
- Open purchase orders linked to the season
- Unpaid supplier balances from the season
- Inventory items still allocated to the season

---

### Gap 6: Partners Page Has No GL Integration
[PartnersPage.tsx](file:///c:/Users/mahmo/Contacts/CLAUDE_CO%20WORK%20MY%20WORK/agri-nile-flow/web/src/pages/treasury/PartnersPage.tsx) — `capital_paid` and `current_acct` are edited directly without creating any journal entry.

**Impact:** Partner equity changes don't appear in the trial balance or financial statements.

